exit 0
# The built-in OWASP CRS v4, for the policies that tune it or add rules.
apiVersion: waf.inkwall.dev/v1alpha1
kind: ClusterWAFRuleSet
metadata:
  name: owasp-crs-v4
spec:
  source:
    builtin: crs-v4
---
# From the ingress-nginx ModSecurity settings of Ingress web/shop.
apiVersion: waf.inkwall.dev/v1alpha1
kind: WAFRuleSet
metadata:
  name: shop-modsecurity-before-crs
  namespace: web
spec:
  source:
    seclang: |
      # annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 2
      SecRule REQUEST_METHOD "@streq OPTIONS" "id:1000,phase:1,pass,nolog,chain"
      SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@beginsWith /api" "ctl:ruleEngine=Off"
      # annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 4
      SecRule ARGS:action "@streq heartbeat" "id:1001,phase:1,pass,nolog,chain"
      SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@streq /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php" "ctl:ruleRemoveById=942100"
      # annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 6
      SecRule REQUEST_HEADERS:X-Debug "@streq 1" "id:1002,phase:1,deny,status:403,chain"
      SecRule REMOTE_ADDR "!@ipMatch 10.0.0.0/8"
---
apiVersion: waf.inkwall.dev/v1alpha1
kind: WAFPolicy
metadata:
  name: shop
  namespace: web
spec:
  mode: Block
  ruleSets:
  - placement: BeforeCRS
    ref:
      kind: WAFRuleSet
      name: shop-modsecurity-before-crs
  - ref:
      kind: ClusterWAFRuleSet
      name: owasp-crs-v4
  targetRefs:
  - kind: Ingress
    name: shop
--- stderr
note: no ConfigMap ingress-nginx/ingress-nginx-controller in the files: ModSecurity is taken as off globally (only the annotations count)
Ingress web/shop: WAFPolicy web/shop (Block), WAFRuleSet web/shop-modsecurity-before-crs
  check   annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 2: kept in the BeforeCRS WAFRuleSet: SecRule REQUEST_METHOD "@streq OPTIONS" "id:1000,phase:1,pass,nolog,chain" SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@beginsWith /api" "ctl:ruleEngine=Off"; ModSecurity ran it before the CRS, and placement: BeforeCRS needs engines 0.6.0 or later (older ones load it after the CRS)
  check   annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 4: kept in the BeforeCRS WAFRuleSet: SecRule ARGS:action "@streq heartbeat" "id:1001,phase:1,pass,nolog,chain" SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@streq /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php" "ctl:ruleRemoveById=942100"; ModSecurity ran it before the CRS, and placement: BeforeCRS needs engines 0.6.0 or later (older ones load it after the CRS)
  check   annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 6: kept in the BeforeCRS WAFRuleSet: SecRule REQUEST_HEADERS:X-Debug "@streq 1" "id:1002,phase:1,deny,status:403,chain" SecRule REMOTE_ADDR "!@ipMatch 10.0.0.0/8"; ModSecurity ran it before the CRS, and placement: BeforeCRS needs engines 0.6.0 or later (older ones load it after the CRS)
  mapped  annotation enable-owasp-core-rules: the built-in OWASP CRS v4
  mapped  annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 1: SecRuleEngine On: mode: Block
